        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 3,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Leviticus 25:3",
        "book": "Leviticus",
        "chapter": 25,
        "verse": 3
      },
      {
        "text": "But in the seventh year shall be a sabbath of rest unto the land, a sabbath for the Lord: thou shalt neither sow thy field, nor prune thy vineyard.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 4,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Leviticus 25:4",
        "book": "Leviticus",
        "chapter": 25,
        "verse": 4
      },
      {
        "text": "That which groweth of its own accord of thy harvest thou shalt not reap, neither gather the grapes of thy vine undressed: for it is a year of rest unto the land.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 99,
            "end": 120,
            "text": "HEB of thy separation; i.e., of the time “set apart” as a sabbatical year."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 122,
            "end": 125
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 5,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Leviticus 25:5",
        "book": "Leviticus",
        "chapter": 25,
        "verse": 5
      },
      {
        "text": "And the sabbath of the land shall be meat for you; for thee, and for thy servant, and for thy maid, and for thy hired servant, and for thy stranger that sojourneth with thee,",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 6,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Leviticus 25:6",
        "book": "Leviticus",
        "chapter": 25,
        "verse": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "And for thy cattle, and for the beast that are in thy land, shall all the increase thereof be meat.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 94,
            "end": 98,
            "text": "HEB to eat."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 43,
            "end": 46
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 7,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Leviticus 25:7",
        "book": "Leviticus",
        "chapter": 25,
        "verse": 7
      },
      {
        "text": "And thou shalt number seven sabbaths of years unto thee, seven times seven years; and the space of the seven sabbaths of years shall be unto thee forty and nine years.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 8,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Leviticus 25:8",
        "book": "Leviticus",
        "chapter": 25,
        "verse": 8
      },
      {
        "text": "Then shalt thou cause the trumpet of the jubilee to sound on the tenth day of the seventh month, in the day of atonement shall ye make the trumpet sound throughout all your land.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 16,
            "end": 21,
            "text": "HEB sound the trill of the ram’s horn."
